G04 KerfKite test fixture: a ground pour with clearances, thermal reliefs and clear cut-outs.*
G04 The pour is a region. Clear discs and an obround open clearances of 0.40 mm round three pads; a clear*
G04 disc crossed by two spokes makes a thermal relief that leaves its pad joined to the pour; a thermal*
G04 macro (primitive 7) sits in a clear disc with 0.50 mm round it and 0.40 mm between its quarters;*
G04 a clear line and a clear region cut slots in the pour, with a track in the second. Beside the pour,*
G04 a region whose contour reaches its hole by a cut-in, with a pad in the hole.*
G04 Written by hand for the test suite. Synthetic data, free to redistribute.*
